  "description": "The main character, Si-U Lee, lost his parents to a murderer ten years ago. Finally, he meets Jack, the one who killed his parents, and beheads him. “It wasn’t me who killed your parents.”\n\nAfter learning that the real culprit is a \"contractor\" belonging to a group of killers using superpowers, Si-U Lee decides to hunt down the registrants with Jack’s help.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
